{"title":"Werewolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Werewolf that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: frenzyCadenceMult: .7</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2141.3px,-1072.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/9/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/9/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:2051.5px;top:1056.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:2157.4px;top:1043.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2143.6px;top:1102.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:2165.0px;top:1089.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:2194.3px;top:1070.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2201.4px;top:1072.5px\"></i></div><figcaption>Moonfang&#39;s Lair</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"werewolf\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Werewolf: <a href=\"#/monster/lycan\">Lycan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\">Alpha Werewolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/19a26d5ca6ce856f2c3f.svg\" alt=\"Werewolf\"></div><h3>Werewolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>30 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 34–37)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Werewolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}